{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 867449534380770616,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "External `rustc_driver`s",
      "source_hash": 8866240655308384710,
      "context_hash": 17332132796539996533,
      "translation": "외부 `rustc_driver`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724310Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "`rustc_private`",
      "source_hash": 2094332531118221963,
      "context_hash": 11736199772413547387,
      "translation": "`rustc_private`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724311Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Overview",
      "source_hash": 11777448466030057203,
      "context_hash": 3375435910824790170,
      "translation": "개요",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724311Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The `rustc_private` feature allows external crates to use compiler internals.",
      "source_hash": 4650534238127528212,
      "context_hash": 6846123160731939474,
      "translation": "`rustc_private` 기능은 외부 크레이트가 컴파일러 내부 요소를 사용할 수 있도록 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724311Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Using `rustc_private` with official toolchains",
      "source_hash": 15097673145534920357,
      "context_hash": 3542688829242397108,
      "translation": "공식 툴체인에서 `rustc_private` 사용하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724311Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "When using the `rustc_private` feature with official Rust toolchains distributed via rustup, you need to install two additional components:",
      "source_hash": 13551572574035478271,
      "context_hash": 703466120835213104,
      "translation": "rustup을 통해 배포되는 공식 Rust 툴체인에서 `rustc_private` 기능을 사용할 때는 두 가지 추가 구성 요소를 설치해야 합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724311Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**`rustc-dev`**: Provides compiler libraries",
      "source_hash": 3274025842531176759,
      "context_hash": 16260475420495245413,
      "translation": "**`rustc-dev`**: 컴파일러 라이브러리를 제공합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724311Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "**`llvm-tools`**: Provides LLVM libraries required for linking",
      "source_hash": 1835123536638757409,
      "context_hash": 1825322557754608941,
      "translation": "**`llvm-tools`**: 링크에 필요한 LLVM 라이브러리를 제공합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724312Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Installation steps",
      "source_hash": 2071347475325618563,
      "context_hash": 11974025700999556972,
      "translation": "설치 단계",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724312Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Install both components using rustup:",
      "source_hash": 439931698036829161,
      "context_hash": 12355684935109822357,
      "translation": "rustup을 사용하여 두 구성 요소를 모두 설치하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724312Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Common error",
      "source_hash": 15357231785146458317,
      "context_hash": 7937664797138374807,
      "translation": "일반적인 오류",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724312Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Without the `llvm-tools` component, you'll encounter linking errors like:",
      "source_hash": 1038295754407029185,
      "context_hash": 9330274891538225355,
      "translation": "`llvm-tools` 구성 요소가 없으면 다음과 같은 링크 오류가 발생합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724312Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Using `rustc-private` with Custom Toolchains",
      "source_hash": 6721898057579195925,
      "context_hash": 10872889708995961993,
      "translation": "커스텀 툴체인에서 `rustc-private` 사용하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724312Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "For custom-built toolchains or environments not using rustup, additional configuration is typically required:",
      "source_hash": 11923902633204911231,
      "context_hash": 13889118499741534703,
      "translation": "직접 빌드한 툴체인이나 rustup을 사용하지 않는 환경에서는 일반적으로 추가 설정이 필요합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724312Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "Requirements",
      "source_hash": 1256682610613689811,
      "context_hash": 17167321871065381152,
      "translation": "요구 사항",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724312Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "LLVM libraries must be available in your system's library search paths",
      "source_hash": 868204130774501899,
      "context_hash": 13843130425803206962,
      "translation": "LLVM 라이브러리는 시스템의 라이브러리 검색 경로에서 사용할 수 있어야 합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724312Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "The LLVM version must match the one used to build your Rust toolchain",
      "source_hash": 545069236727741491,
      "context_hash": 12584631521474873322,
      "translation": "LLVM 버전은 Rust 툴체인을 빌드하는 데 사용된 버전과 일치해야 합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724312Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "Troubleshooting steps",
      "source_hash": 6615314084296450448,
      "context_hash": 14438902179718433836,
      "translation": "문제 해결 단계",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724313Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "Verify LLVM is installed and accessible",
      "source_hash": 14095372470801443993,
      "context_hash": 13109264289070082,
      "translation": "LLVM이 설치되어 있고 접근 가능한지 확인하십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724313Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:20/seg:0",
      "source": "Ensure that library paths are set:",
      "source_hash": 6631110820270848915,
      "context_hash": 1648057672695323411,
      "translation": "라이브러리 경로가 설정되어 있는지 확인하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724313Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:22/seg:0",
      "source": "Ensure your LLVM version is compatible with your Rust toolchain",
      "source_hash": 968567922725679287,
      "context_hash": 16740499239203453691,
      "translation": "LLVM 버전이 Rust 툴체인과 호환되는지 확인하십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724313Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:23/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuring `rust-analyzer` for out-of-tree projects",
      "source_hash": 8317995984434658643,
      "context_hash": 4343676963565052012,
      "translation": "트리 외부 프로젝트를 위한 `rust-analyzer` 설정하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724313Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:24/seg:0",
      "source": "When developing out-of-tree projects that use `rustc_private` crates, you can configure `rust-analyzer` to recognize these crates.",
      "source_hash": 2755191129218537134,
      "context_hash": 8702378819598759159,
      "translation": "`rustc_private` 크레이트를 사용하는 트리 외부 프로젝트를 개발할 때는 `rust-analyzer`가 이러한 크레이트를 인식하도록 설정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724313Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:25/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration steps",
      "source_hash": 8856627329437685829,
      "context_hash": 10527215140756638687,
      "translation": "설정 단계",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724313Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:26/seg:0",
      "source": "Configure `rust-analyzer.rustc.source` to `\"discover\"` in your editor settings.",
      "source_hash": 34943713984578945,
      "context_hash": 3843524238165526131,
      "translation": "에디터 설정에서 `rust-analyzer.rustc.source`를 `\"discover\"`로 설정하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724313Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:27/seg:0",
      "source": "For VS Code, add to `rust_analyzer_settings.json`:",
      "source_hash": 17772798171048315728,
      "context_hash": 2255703401359219293,
      "translation": "VS Code의 경우 `rust_analyzer_settings.json`에 다음을 추가하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724313Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:29/seg:0",
      "source": "Add the following to the `Cargo.toml` of every crate that uses `rustc_private`:",
      "source_hash": 6690121013157961857,
      "context_hash": 15524845691226629827,
      "translation": "`rustc_private`를 사용하는 모든 크레이트의 `Cargo.toml`에 다음을 추가하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "crate": "크레이트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724313Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:31/seg:0",
      "source": "This configuration allows `rust-analyzer` to properly recognize and provide IDE support for `rustc_private` crates in out-of-tree projects.",
      "source_hash": 17812930633691550223,
      "context_hash": 9945063359343543654,
      "translation": "이 설정을 통해 `rust-analyzer`는 트리 외부 프로젝트에서 `rustc_private` 크레이트를 올바르게 인식하고 IDE 지원을 제공할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724314Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:32/seg:0",
      "source": "Getting nightly documentation for `rustc_private`",
      "source_hash": 5650873127449934407,
      "context_hash": 9614417779075197363,
      "translation": "`rustc_private`의 nightly 문서 가져오기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724314Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:33/seg:0",
      "source": "Latest nightly",
      "source_hash": 14504825646730069877,
      "context_hash": 537561890384172690,
      "translation": "최신 nightly",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724314Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:34/seg:0",
      "source": "For the latest nightly, you can install the `rustc-docs` component and open it directly in your browser:",
      "source_hash": 2438301522941698734,
      "context_hash": 12209936502184870790,
      "translation": "최신 nightly의 경우, `rustc-docs` 구성 요소를 설치하여 브라우저에서 바로 열어볼 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:14.724314Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:36/seg:0",
      "source": "Note: The `rustc-docs` component is only available for recent nightly toolchains and may not be present for every nightly date.",
      "source_hash": 13745755770720970152,
      "context_hash": 8995908871255297559,
      "translation": "참고: `rustc-docs` 컴포넌트는 최신 나이틀리 툴체인에서만 제공되며, 모든 나이틀리 날짜에 존재하지는 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:23.929010Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:36/seg:1",
      "source": "It was first introduced in [PR #75560](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/pull/75560) (August 2020).",
      "source_hash": 1495137833275754958,
      "context_hash": 10690160910116866248,
      "translation": "이는 [PR #75560](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/pull/75560)(2020년 8월)에서 처음 도입되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:23.929011Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:37/seg:0",
      "source": "Older nightlies",
      "source_hash": 18423716641300202754,
      "context_hash": 14006789765423228403,
      "translation": "이전 나이틀리",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:23.929011Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:38/seg:0",
      "source": "If you depend on compiler internals from an older nightly, you may want to refer to the internal documentation from that particular nightly.",
      "source_hash": 10158981702308464598,
      "context_hash": 1386432148229206412,
      "translation": "이전 나이틀리의 컴파일러 내부 구현에 의존하는 경우, 해당 특정 나이틀리의 내부 문서를 참조해야 할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:23.929011Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:38/seg:1",
      "source": "The only way to do this is to generate the documentation locally.",
      "source_hash": 11101515510325524365,
      "context_hash": 17587380278481917468,
      "translation": "이를 수행하는 유일한 방법은 문서를 로컬에서 생성하는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:23.929012Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:38/seg:2",
      "source": "For example, to get documentation for `nightly-2025-11-08`:",
      "source_hash": 7302542817127469622,
      "context_hash": 14082202991776881268,
      "translation": "예를 들어, `nightly-2025-11-08`의 문서를 얻으려면 다음과 같이 하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:23.929012Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:39/seg:0",
      "source": "Get the Git commit hash for that nightly:",
      "source_hash": 2213789517041766279,
      "context_hash": 4312250947256827770,
      "translation": "해당 나이틀리의 Git 커밋 해시를 가져오십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:23.929012Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:41/seg:0",
      "source": "The output will include a `commit-hash` line identifying the exact source revision.",
      "source_hash": 1146689239830044654,
      "context_hash": 17732224778568762777,
      "translation": "출력에는 정확한 소스 리비전을 식별하는 `commit-hash` 줄이 포함됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:23.929012Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:41/seg:1",
      "source": "Check out `rust-lang/rust` at that commit, then follow the steps in [compiler documentation](../building/compiler-documenting.md).",
      "source_hash": 422336765561774496,
      "context_hash": 834744532185742459,
      "translation": "해당 커밋에서 `rust-lang/rust`를 체크아웃한 다음, [컴파일러 문서](../building/compiler-documenting.md)의 단계를 따르십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:23.929012Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:42/seg:0",
      "source": "Additional resources",
      "source_hash": 14730990757954509583,
      "context_hash": 14406624986450583718,
      "translation": "추가 자료",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:23.929013Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:43/seg:0",
      "source": "[GitHub Issue #137421] explains that `rustc_private` linker failures often occur because `llvm-tools` is not installed",
      "source_hash": 4257868987270070810,
      "context_hash": 10340350929403211834,
      "translation": "[GitHub Issue #137421]은 `llvm-tools`가 설치되지 않아 `rustc_private` 링커 오류가 자주 발생한다고 설명합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:01:23.929013Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}